# Ignores that travel with the repo: they are committed, so they should describe
# the project rather than one machine. Personal, always-on ignores (.DS_Store,
# .env, editor directories) belong in .git/info/exclude instead, which is not
# committed.

# Output of the Playwright MCP browser: page snapshots, screenshots and console
# logs left behind while reviewing a change. Remove this rule in a repo that
# needs to track those artifacts.
.playwright-mcp/
